<title>JAMAICA: CRICKET-WEST INDIES V INDIA SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES V INDIA SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTON, Jamaica 1997-03-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard at the close of play on the third day of the first test match between West Indies and India at Sabina Park on Saturday</p>
<p>West Indies - First Innings 427 all out (C.Hooper 129, B.Lara 83, S.Chanderpaul 52; A.Kumble 5-120, A.Kuruvilla 3-82).</p>
<p>India - First Innings</p>
<p>(Overnight 108-1)</p>
<p> V.V.Laxman b Rose		    64</p>
<p> N.Sidhu lbw Bishop		   10</p>
<p> R.Dravid c Murray b Rose	   43</p>
<p> S.Tendulkar b Rose		    7</p>
<p> S.Ganguly c Lara b Rose	    42</p>
<p> M.Azharuddin c Lara b Rose	  5</p>
<p> N.Mongia not out		     74</p>
<p> A.Kumble b Bishop		     7</p>
<p> S.Joshi not out			23</p>
<p> Extras (b4, lb8, nb21)	     33</p>
<p> Total (for seven wickets)	 308</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-32, 2-127, 3-140, 4-145, 5-153, 6-234, 7- 248.</p>
<p>Bowling: Ambrose 24-9-35-0, Bishop 24-4-59-2, Rose 6-6-79-5, Walsh 25-5-61-0, Hooper 21-9-40-0, Chanderpaul 11-4-22-0.</p>
